OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny rain quickly clearing to
OL,6,Fthe south leaving a mostly dry day
OL,7,Fwith bright or sunny spells developing
OL,8,Ffrom the north. Breezy around coasts
OL,9,Fat first but easing later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining dry and settled
OL,12,Fthrough the evening and overnight.
OL,13,FLong clear spells developing which
OL,14,Fwill lead to a cold and frosty night.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FAfter a cold and frosty start,
OL,17,Fit will be a dry day with largely
OL,18,Fclear skies and plenty of sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
